  "description": "Everyone knows Kang Su-hyun. The Class president, social butterfly, the kind of guy who shines in every corner of campus life. But even the brightest star has shadows.His secret? He runs a private “alt account,” an anonymous SNS page where he draws and posts scandalous 19+ art. It’s his hidden world, one that absolutely no one can ever discover.At least, that was the plan.One day, his double life is accidentally exposed to the very last person he’d want: Lim Ji-ah, the school outcast who barely talks to anyone.“Wait… sunbae, you’re that famous lewd artist? Hehe… guess I’ve got some leverage now, huh?”From that moment on, Su-hyun’s carefully maintained image as Mr. Perfect begins to crumble.Stuck between bribes, blackmail, and the most awkward partnership imaginable, can a campus golden boy survive having his NSFW alter ego in the hands of an unlikely accomplice?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
